    ["<P_Heart>（拿起星币八）</>这是你的牌。工匠的手，一枚一枚地雕刻。很慢，很辛苦。"] = "<P_Heart> (Picks up the Eight of Pentacles) </> This is your card. A craftsman's hands, carving one by one. Very slow, very hard work.",
