    ["亲爱的非凡者：\n系统检测到您的角色存在语音违规行为，现已被禁止语音发言。\n良好的游戏环境需要广大玩家共同守护，也希望您能自觉遵守规则。若违规持续，处罚将会升级，包括但不限于延长禁麦时间/永久禁麦。如果您还有其他疑问和诉求，可联系游戏客服反馈申诉。"] = "Dear Beyonder: \nThe system has detected voice violations in your character, and you have been banned from voice chat. \nA good gaming environment requires the joint protection of all players, and we hope you can consciously abide by the rules. If the violation continues, the penalty will be upgraded, including but not limited to extending the mute time/permanent mute. If you have other questions and requests, you can contact game customer service for feedback and appeals.",
